{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\"better\":\"Y\",\"regress\":\"有：Y在S03、S08等较短段落里感受提示切换较密，观众容易来不及扫完；X的双栏短词更适合一眼掠读。\",\"nets\":{\"scan\":\"X\",\"point\":\"Y\",\"why\":\"Y\",\"whole\":\"Y\",\"fine\":\"Y\"},\"why\":\"X的双栏布局和短词更利于快速扫屏，但Y通过关键句加亮，让每段真正重要的情节转折更容易被抓住，并通过感受与音乐时点的对应增强理解。尤其Y把想念亲近、害怕孤单、不甘心再受委屈这几股力量之间的拉扯交代得更清楚，人物心理的前后变化也更连贯；感受描写则有更多具体的声音、节奏和身体反应，细腻程度更好。整体而言，Y虽然牺牲了一些一眼扫过的轻松感，但换来了更强的理解、连贯性和音乐体验。\"} </escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "270594e9-de66-4937-8cc2-385159fe9def", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261108T022440041260Z", "elapsed_seconds": 58.328, "completed_utc": "2026-11-08T02:25:38.389903+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "8fef5219ef7e346660c21b4a54b9055498770242a8b44cadf1c0b47d2cfb06b2", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700f6306b1d1f4582896a7